{"sha": "2c165d52a1c4c8a1216e8215787c301822858c0ff4d5c58bbb1beb1ec766c883", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:fluid-kinematics:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 穿过半径为 $r$ 的圆柱面：$2\\pi rh|v_r| = D_V$，于是", "$v_r = -q/2\\pi r$, $q = D_V/h = \\qty{1.5e-3}{m^2/s}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $rv_\\theta = 0.5 \\times 0.01 = \\qty{5e-3}{m^2/s}$: $v_\\theta = \\Gamma/2\\pi r$", "其中 $\\Gamma = \\qty{3.1e-2}{m^2/s}$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\operatorname{div}\\vect v = \\frac1r\\partial_r(rv_r) = 0$, $\\omega_z =", "\\frac1r\\partial_r(rv_\\theta) = 0$.", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\dd r/r = -(q/\\Gamma)\\dd\\theta$：$r = r_0\\eu^{-q\\theta/\\Gamma}$；圈数", "$= (\\Gamma/2\\pi q)\\ln(r_0/a) = 3.3 \\times 3.2 \\approx 11$.", "", "\\textbf{5.} $t = \\pi(r_0^2 - a^2)/q = \\qty{520}{s} \\approx \\qty{9}{min}$; $v_\\theta(a) =", "\\qty{0.25}{m/s}$.", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\vect a = -(v^2/r)\\vect e_r$；当 $r = a$ 时，$v^2 = 0.25^2 + 0.012^2$，", "$a = \\qty{3.1}{m/s^2} \\approx 0.3g$.", "", "\\textbf{7.} $\\Omega_\\oplus\\sin\\lambda\\,r = 5 \\times 10^{-5} \\times 0.5 = \\qty{2.5e-5}{m/s}$,", "比搅拌作用小四百倍：半球效应", "在普通浴缸中毫无影响（若在静置一天的水箱中则有影响）。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $v_\\theta = \\Omega r$ ($r < a$), $\\Omega a^2/r$ ($r > a$); $\\Omega = 80/60", "= \\qty{1.33}{rad/s}$, $\\Gamma = 2\\pi av_{\\max} = \\qty{3.0e4}{m^2/s}$.", "", "\\textbf{9.} $\\omega_z = 2\\Omega = \\qty{2.7}{s^{-1}}$ 在核心区内，外部为 $0$；", "$v_\\theta$ 线性增至 \\qty{80}{m/s}，随后按 $1/r$ 减小；$\\omega_z$ 呈", "阶跃状。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $a = v_{\\max}^2/a = 6400/60 = \\qty{107}{m/s^2} \\approx 11g$，指向中心。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 外部涡量为零：一小块流体微团沿其圆周作平动", "而不绕自身转动 --- 桨轮", "保持其取向。在核心区（刚体旋转）中，它随", "流体转动，每绕行一圈自转一次。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $E_{\\text{核心区}} = \\int_0^a\\tfrac12\\rho\\Omega^2r^2\\,2\\pi r\\,\\dd r =", "\\tfrac14\\pi\\rho\\Omega^2a^4 = \\qty{2.2e7}{J/m}$.", "", "\\textbf{13.} $E_{\\text{外部}} = \\int_a^R\\tfrac12\\rho(\\Omega a^2/r)^2\\,2\\pi r\\,\\dd r =", "\\pi\\rho\\Omega^2a^4\\ln(R/a) = 8.7 \\times 10^7 \\times 4.4 = \\qty{3.8e8}{J/m}$；被积函数", "$\\rho v^2r \\propto 1/r$，故出现对数。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $\\qty{4.0e8}{J/m} \\times \\qty{1000}{m} = \\qty{4e11}{J}$：相当于约", "\\qty{100}{t} TNT 当量。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 流入量 $2\\pi a \\times 300 \\times 5 = \\qty{5.7e5}{m^3/s}$ 穿过", "面积 $\\pi a^2 = \\qty{1.1e4}{m^2}$：$v_z = \\qty{50}{m/s}$。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $\\omega = 2v_{\\max}/a = \\qty{2.5e-3}{s^{-1}} = 50f$; $\\Gamma = 2\\pi av_{\\max}", "= \\qty{1.3e7}{m^2/s}$.", "", "\\textbf{17.} $r_0\\cdot fr_0/2 = r(v_\\theta + fr/2)$: $v_\\theta = f(r_0^2 - r^2)/2r$;", "\\qty{60}{m/s} 对应 \\qty{100}{km}，\\qty{155}{m/s} 对应 \\qty{40}{km}。", "", "\\textbf{18.} 在北半球，$f > 0$ 给出 $v_\\theta > 0$：", "从上方看为逆时针方向（气旋式）。在 \\qty{500}{km} 尺度上，", "行星自转是主要的初始旋转；在浴缸中", "则是搅拌。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 与海面的摩擦带走角动量，而", "压强梯度无法平衡", "越转越快的环状气流所需的向心加速度：空气在到达轴线前", "即在眼墙处上升，留下平静的台风眼。", "", "\\textbf{20.} $\\rho\\,2\\pi rHv = 1.2 \\times 2\\pi \\times 5 \\times 10^5 \\times 10^3 \\times 5 =", "\\qty{1.9e10}{kg/s}$.", "", "\\textbf{21.} $\\vect v(M, t) = -U\\vect e_x + \\vect v_0(M + Ut\\,\\vect e_x)$：图样", "被平流输运，场在地面参考系中非定常。", "平动速度与涡旋叠加于 $v_\\theta$ 指向", "西的一侧 --- 即西行轨迹的北（右手）侧。", "", "\\textbf{22.} $0.05 \\times 10^7/3600 = \\qty{139}{m^3/s}$; $v = 139/40 = \\qty{3.5}{m/s}$.", "", "\\textbf{23.} $D_V = \\qty{83}{cm^3/s}$：主动脉 \\qty{0.33}{m/s}；毛细血管", "\\qty{0.33}{mm/s}；每毫米 \\qty{3}{s}。", "", "\\textbf{24.} $S\\,\\dd h/\\dd t = -s\\sqrt{2gh}$: $\\sqrt h = \\sqrt{h_0} -", "\\frac sS\\sqrt{g/2}\\,t$，在 $T = (S/s)\\sqrt{2h_0/g} = 10^4 \\times 0.45 =", "\\qty{4500}{s} \\approx \\qty{75}{min}$ 时排空。", "", "\\textbf{25.} 浴缸：$r \\sim \\qty{0.5}{m}$，$v \\sim \\qty{1}{cm/s}$，$\\Gamma =", "\\qty{3e-2}{m^2/s}$；龙卷风：\\qty{60}{m}，\\qty{80}{m/s}，$\\omega = \\qty{2.7}{s^{-1}}$，", "$\\Gamma = \\qty{3e4}{m^2/s}$；气旋：\\qty{40}{km}，\\qty{50}{m/s}，$\\omega =", "\\qty{2.5e-3}{s^{-1}}$，$\\Gamma = \\qty{1.3e7}{m^2/s}$。在各情形中，会聚流体的", "单位质量角动量 $rv_\\theta$ 守恒：", "流入使其加速旋转。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}